<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT PARAGUAY 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT PARAGUAY 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Bolivia 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat</p>
<p>Paraguay 2-0 (halftime 2-0) in a Copa America quarter-final</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Ronaldo (17,34)</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>Semi-finals:</p>
<p>June 25: In La Paz, Bolivia v Mexico</p>
<p>June 26: In Santa Cruz, Brazil v Peru</p>
</text>
